{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:11:34.506Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1ab7be87e08587042d760f94954a445d062545bb1f379bddde4784cf4f124ea5","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account and changed hands on 2026-05-04 (the 5/3 digest says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day). Later digests (8/3) call it Gideon's biggest account.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management of it that day. Earlier digests already describe it as Gideon's fleet account, so I'd check the date if the slide needs one for Mobility.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest lists it as \"Gideon's medical account\". It was Nadia's in the March 2025 digest.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't say. They only call it the pod's outdoor or retail account, and the 9/30 digest has Nadia volunteering to host its gate-clerk training. That doesn't show ownership, so I'd confirm with the CRM or the pod before it goes on the slide.\n\nThe digests don't name the new owner of Vantorre Group outright. I got Gideon from the 5/4 digest calling it \"Gideon's industrial account\", plus the 8/3 digest.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:11:39.177Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"196937616b6ad9e3bd120f55bcc75807b9094f154e0be957272e5dcb427b1b5d","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I posted the answer in the #strategic-pod thread. Three of the four owners come from the digests. Quillfeather isn't confirmed.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04, from Nadia Fennimore. The 5/3 digest says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day. The digests never name Gideon outright. I inferred him from the 5/4 digest (\"Gideon's industrial account\") and the 8/3 digest (\"Gideon's biggest account\").\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management of it that day. Earlier digests already call it his fleet account, so check that date if the slide needs one for Mobility.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest calls it \"Gideon's medical account\". It was Nadia's in the March 2025 digest.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't say who owns it. The 9/30 digest has Nadia volunteering to host its gate-clerk training, which doesn't show ownership. I suggested confirming in the CRM or with the pod before it goes on the slide."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
